# CatalystLab edge redirects — Cloudflare Pages (owner decisions D14 and D3/Q31)
#
# Format: <from> <to> [<status>]  (a 200 is a rewrite, 301/302 are redirects)
# Static assets — including the prerendered route shells written by
# scripts/prerender.ts — are matched before these rules, so a prerendered
# /pricing/index.html always wins over the rewrites below.
#
# /api/* is NOT handled here: Q31 chose a Cloudflare Worker route on the apex
# zone that forwards /api/* to the Node API host (see worker/api-proxy.js).

# --- D14: www is canonical; the apex 301s to it ---
https://catalystlab.tech/*  https://www.catalystlab.tech/:splat  301
https://catalystlab.tech/   https://www.catalystlab.tech/        301

